#pragma code_page(65001)
// res/lang/bn.rc -- Bengali, the strings of the interface for `[general] language = "bn"`.
//
// Stage E108, group A: the two string tables of this language -- the dialog block and the
// menu block -- in the order of en.rc; app.rc includes this file. The rules every table obeys
// stand in app.rc above the #include lines; where each string is seen and how much room it has
// is res/lang/context.tsv; tests/l10n.rs holds this file to en.rc.
//
// ⚠ In an .rc string a backslash is an escape -- one backslash is written as two -- and a double
// quote inside a string is written as two double quotes. The code page line above is this
// file's own: without it rc.exe reads the file in the ANSI code page, silently.

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Bengali (Bangla) — `[general] language = "bn"`, LANGID 0x0445.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
